---
// src/components/AboutMe.astro
const image = "/assets/imglucas1.png";
---

<section
  class="my-16 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 mt-13 sm:mt-35"
>
  <div class="md:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1 text-start md:text-start">Hola! Soy Lucas,</h2>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 text-start md:text-start">Estudiante de Sistemas.</h1>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3 justify-start md:justify-start">
      <span class="bg-sky-600 text-white text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide px-2 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">
        Trainee en Desarrollo Full Stack
      </span>
      <span class="bg-sky-900 text-white text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide px-2 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">
        Enfoque UX/UI
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-start md:text-start">
      Desarrollador en formación con ganas de crear experiencias únicas en la
      web. Busco que mis proyectos se vean bien, funcionen mejor, y crezcan
      conmigo. Lo ideal es que el usuario se sienta cómodo.
    </p>

<div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start">
  <!-- Botón Mi Curriculum: ancho completo en mobile -->
  <a
    href="LucasSoraire-CurriculumVitae.pdf"
    download
    class="bg-white text-black w-full sm:w-auto px-4 py-4 sm:px-5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl font-semibold shadow-md hover:bg-neutral-200 flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-center gap-2 text-sm sm:text-base mt-3 md:mt-0 transform transition duration-300 ease-in-out 
    hover:scale-100 hover:-translate-y-1"
  >
    <img src="/icons/descargas.png" alt="CV Icon" width="20" height="20" />
    Mi Curriculum
  </a>

  <!-- Contenedor para los dos botones chicos -->
  <div class="flex flex-row gap-3 justify-center sm:justify-start">
    <a
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lucas-soraire-920515307"
      target="_blank"
      class="text-white hover:text-blue-400  flex items-center gap-2 border border-white px-13 py-4 sm:p-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base  transform transition duration-300 ease-in-out 
    hover:scale-100 hover:-translate-y-1"
    >
      <img src="/icons/linkedin.png" alt="LinkedIn Icon" width="20" height="20" />
      LinkedIn
    </a>

    <a
      href="https://github.com/lucassoraire"
      target="_blank"
      class="text-white hover:text-indigo-500 flex items-center gap-2 border border-white px-13 py-4 sm:p-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base  transform transition duration-300 ease-in-out 
    hover:scale-100 hover:-translate-y-1"
    >
      <img src="/icons/github.png" alt="GitHub Icon" width="20" height="20" />
      Github
    </a>
  </div>
</div>



  </div>

<div class="w-full md:w-[500px] h-auto aspect-video rounded-md shadow-[0_0_70px_rgba(59,130,246,0.5)] flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2e3033] via-[#404652] to-[#14203a]">

    <img src={image} alt="Foto de Lucas" class="rounded-md img-fluid" />
  </div>
</section>
